WEBVTT

00:00:12.860 --> 00:00:16.750
The continent of Kunaan was 
ruled by sword and sorcery.

00:00:16.750 --> 00:00:20.410
Three powerful countries existed there.

00:00:22.110 --> 00:00:26.080
The Kingdom of Saint Amoria, 
the Kingdom of Ishilfeen,

00:00:26.370 --> 00:00:29.130
and the Kingdom of Vanlodis.

00:00:29.610 --> 00:00:32.910
They were all equally powerful,

00:00:32.910 --> 00:00:35.500
and it was clear that any trouble in one

00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:39.640
would immediately start
a continent-wide war.

00:00:40.640 --> 00:00:46.970
And there was an evil dragon on 
the continent that all men feared.

00:00:47.800 --> 00:00:50.650
His name was Dagan Zot.

00:00:52.270 --> 00:00:58.190
He scorched the earth, and 
brought disaster to the people.

00:00:59.750 --> 00:01:06.170
Humanity tried to seal him away, but failed.

00:01:07.540 --> 00:01:10.960
This became known as The 
Disaster at Balbagoa.

00:01:12.570 --> 00:01:14.170
Ten years later,

00:01:14.920 --> 00:01:21.260
Hiiro, who lost his parents during 
the Disaster and swore revenge,

00:01:21.260 --> 00:01:24.280
was suddenly confronted by Dagan Zot.

00:03:02.070 --> 00:03:04.590
Beat, beat, beat.

00:03:05.310 --> 00:03:09.080
The beating of your heart 
is a very pretty sound.

00:03:09.660 --> 00:03:11.280
I like it.

00:03:13.810 --> 00:03:16.050
Come with me.

00:03:17.670 --> 00:03:19.170
That's a bad idea!

00:03:19.170 --> 00:03:21.970
She just came out of the 
mouth of a sand dragon!

00:03:23.150 --> 00:03:25.840
And she's got a magic wand!

00:03:26.260 --> 00:03:29.000
G-Go where?

00:03:29.000 --> 00:03:30.650
To where you are.

00:03:30.650 --> 00:03:32.110
To you.

00:03:32.830 --> 00:03:35.680
Which means... here?

00:03:41.020 --> 00:03:42.530
What are you?

00:03:43.130 --> 00:03:44.510
I'm Saraato.

00:03:44.510 --> 00:03:45.320
You don't know me?

00:03:45.320 --> 00:03:46.660
Of course not!

00:03:46.660 --> 00:03:47.530
That's right.

00:03:47.530 --> 00:03:49.850
I don't know your name either.

00:03:50.340 --> 00:03:52.480
What is your name?

00:03:53.560 --> 00:03:54.970
H-Hiiro.

00:03:54.970 --> 00:03:56.770
Hiiro. A good name.

00:04:00.460 --> 00:04:03.830
Your eyes are like a deep lake, aren't they?

00:04:03.830 --> 00:04:09.130
Is it a goddess that sleeps deep 
within them, or a white horse?

00:04:11.860 --> 00:04:14.130
No, perhaps it's a dragon.

00:04:18.190 --> 00:04:21.190
Y-Y-Young Master, who is that girl?

00:04:21.580 --> 00:04:23.310
I don't know!

00:04:23.310 --> 00:04:24.610
She just came out of nowhere!

00:04:24.610 --> 00:04:25.510
That's right!

00:04:25.510 --> 00:04:27.650
Out of a dragon's mouth, to be specific!

00:04:27.650 --> 00:04:30.410
She must be a demihuman 
or some kind of monster!

00:04:34.000 --> 00:04:35.350
No, no!

00:04:35.350 --> 00:04:37.980
She doesn't look like a monster.

00:04:37.980 --> 00:04:39.690
Hiiro, look.

00:04:41.160 --> 00:04:42.690
Pretty little pebbles.

00:04:44.910 --> 00:04:47.010
Where did you come from?

00:04:47.010 --> 00:04:49.000
From deep within the earth?

00:04:49.000 --> 00:04:51.780
Or from the heavens where the stars shine?

00:04:51.780 --> 00:04:53.190
What do we do?

00:04:53.190 --> 00:04:56.280
It's best not to get 
involved with those types.

00:04:56.280 --> 00:04:57.560
Let's just ignore her.

00:05:21.610 --> 00:05:22.880
This is good.

00:05:23.860 --> 00:05:24.890
Get that for me.

00:05:25.740 --> 00:05:26.450
Right.

00:05:27.260 --> 00:05:29.070
If you're not eating it, I'll take it.

00:05:29.070 --> 00:05:30.110
I am eating it!

00:05:31.760 --> 00:05:34.650
You still thinking about that girl?

00:05:34.650 --> 00:05:35.710
I am not.

00:05:35.710 --> 00:05:36.830
Liar.

00:05:36.830 --> 00:05:38.180
You're spacing out.

00:05:38.180 --> 00:05:40.400
You're in love. Just admit it.

00:05:40.400 --> 00:05:41.760
I am not!

00:05:41.760 --> 00:05:45.010
A bit ago you were all excited 
to take out that dragon

00:05:45.010 --> 00:05:48.410
and avenge your parents, 
and now you're in love?

00:05:49.630 --> 00:05:53.470
I'm going to defeat Dagan Zot! Right now!

00:05:53.470 --> 00:05:55.940
I-I don't have time for—

00:05:55.940 --> 00:05:56.890
For girls. Right.

00:05:56.890 --> 00:05:58.530
I know.

00:06:04.780 --> 00:06:07.420
She was just sitting 
there picking up pebbles.

00:06:08.520 --> 00:06:10.220
She looked sad,

00:06:10.830 --> 00:06:13.390
like she was all alone.

00:06:16.160 --> 00:06:19.420
What? Just leave her.

00:06:19.420 --> 00:06:21.750
If she's lonely she can make some friends.

00:06:23.030 --> 00:06:24.440
Me and these other guys,

00:06:24.440 --> 00:06:27.270
we don't even know who our parents 
are, or if we've got siblings.

00:06:28.590 --> 00:06:31.280
But even if we're not family,

00:06:31.790 --> 00:06:33.410
we've survived.

00:06:34.290 --> 00:06:35.620
You're the same—

00:06:36.310 --> 00:06:39.100
Sorry. Your parents are...

00:06:40.030 --> 00:06:42.450
It was before I was old enough to remember.

00:06:42.950 --> 00:06:44.370
I don't remember it well.

00:06:46.170 --> 00:06:48.770
And now that you're a little more grown up,

00:06:48.770 --> 00:06:52.220
you can't stop thinking 
about this lonely girl.

00:06:52.220 --> 00:06:54.090
I said no!

00:06:54.090 --> 00:06:55.740
Wipe that stupid smirk off your face.

00:06:55.740 --> 00:06:57.170
Sure, sure.

00:06:57.980 --> 00:07:02.250
Don't lose your mind just 
because you met a girl.

00:07:10.630 --> 00:07:13.250
He's the one who caused that 
trouble in the plaza a bit ago.

00:07:13.710 --> 00:07:15.430
Any idea where he is?

00:07:15.430 --> 00:07:18.620
If you know and don't tell us, you'll pay!

00:07:18.620 --> 00:07:20.290
I-I don't know!

00:07:22.740 --> 00:07:23.670
Sheesh.

00:07:23.670 --> 00:07:25.290
Where'd he go?

00:07:25.960 --> 00:07:29.150
Did you really search the <i>entire</i> town?

00:07:31.760 --> 00:07:33.260
Forget it.

00:07:33.710 --> 00:07:37.390
It'd be faster for me to 
use my magic to find him.

00:07:38.750 --> 00:07:41.460
Mirror, mirror, mirror.

00:07:41.460 --> 00:07:45.310
Where's the thing I'm looking for?

00:07:47.940 --> 00:07:49.470
What's this?

00:07:51.130 --> 00:07:51.990
Huh?

00:07:51.990 --> 00:07:53.830
It's not working right.

00:08:05.210 --> 00:08:06.340
That's right.

00:08:06.340 --> 00:08:09.440
Tell the palace that Dagan Zot has revived.

00:08:11.120 --> 00:08:15.840
I've taken the necessary arrangements 
with all the countries.

00:08:15.840 --> 00:08:19.260
Once you start a rumor,

00:08:19.260 --> 00:08:21.850
the people's fear of the 
dragon will do the rest.

00:08:22.770 --> 00:08:27.920
The world will fill with terror and 
they'll seek a way to protect themselves.

00:08:27.920 --> 00:08:29.040
<i>As you say.</i>

00:08:33.150 --> 00:08:37.310
I want a massive increase in the 
amount of magic stone production.

00:08:38.070 --> 00:08:42.620
But keep an eye on the price 
increases for weapons and armor.

00:08:43.410 --> 00:08:47.030
Too much of a rise and it will 
make it hard for trade to happen.

00:08:47.530 --> 00:08:48.590
<i>Understood.</i>

00:08:51.890 --> 00:08:53.380
Doctor Baffaloppa.

00:08:57.090 --> 00:08:59.050
The war will be here soon.

00:08:59.580 --> 00:09:03.140
All the kings of the three countries 
will struggle to get the most weapons.

00:09:04.060 --> 00:09:06.140
I don't want to miss this chance.

00:09:06.140 --> 00:09:09.980
Develop some new product that they'll want.

00:09:10.980 --> 00:09:12.680
Something that will attract their attention.

00:09:12.680 --> 00:09:15.870
Something more powerful 
than they've ever seen.

00:09:18.550 --> 00:09:19.640
Doctor?

00:09:19.640 --> 00:09:21.160
<i>Right.</i>

00:09:27.250 --> 00:09:31.410
Are you okay, Saraato?

00:09:32.860 --> 00:09:34.130
I found you, Hiiro.

00:09:34.750 --> 00:09:36.310
Not, "I found you."

00:09:36.310 --> 00:09:37.670
Where did you come from?

00:09:39.350 --> 00:09:42.120
So she's the pebble collector?

00:09:42.120 --> 00:09:44.640
She's cuter than I thought.

00:09:44.640 --> 00:09:45.520
No, no.

00:09:45.520 --> 00:09:47.890
How did you find this place anyway?

00:09:47.890 --> 00:09:49.990
I can find the things that are important.

00:09:50.970 --> 00:09:52.560
Is she just stupid?

00:09:52.560 --> 00:09:54.590
She's no mage.

00:09:55.130 --> 00:09:57.490
I guess she does have what looks like a wand.

00:09:58.840 --> 00:10:00.910
You came to find me?

00:10:01.200 --> 00:10:04.520
Where you are is where I am.

00:10:04.520 --> 00:10:06.290
What's with this girl?

00:10:06.290 --> 00:10:07.040
No clue.

00:10:07.310 --> 00:10:09.780
I-I see.

00:10:09.780 --> 00:10:13.910
I guess the fight with Dagan 
Zot's getting postponed.

00:10:14.450 --> 00:10:15.470
Shut up!

00:10:15.470 --> 00:10:17.320
She was alone in the desert 
and needed my help.

00:10:17.320 --> 00:10:18.720
Of course I have to help her!

00:10:18.990 --> 00:10:21.010
Help her?

00:10:21.010 --> 00:10:24.220
So what, you're letting her stay here?

00:10:25.760 --> 00:10:28.280
One more person shouldn't make 
too much of a difference, right?

00:10:28.280 --> 00:10:29.940
Yeah. Don't worry.

00:10:29.940 --> 00:10:31.530
We won't get in your way.

00:10:31.530 --> 00:10:33.400
That's not it.

00:10:34.280 --> 00:10:35.150
Come this way.

00:10:35.870 --> 00:10:37.940
He's a lot more strong-willed than usual.

00:10:38.250 --> 00:10:40.400
And he's not even bothering to ask us.

00:10:50.460 --> 00:10:53.110
What? Only this much?

00:10:53.110 --> 00:10:55.670
We can't buy any weapons with this.

00:10:56.230 --> 00:10:59.440
We don't have enough to pay for our journey.

00:10:59.440 --> 00:11:01.640
We need to hunt something that pays better.

00:11:02.790 --> 00:11:04.150
I'm going hunting again.

00:11:05.610 --> 00:11:06.890
Did the young master go to train?

00:11:07.120 --> 00:11:07.750
Yeah.

00:11:07.750 --> 00:11:10.950
He just left. With witch girl.

00:11:10.950 --> 00:11:12.490
Not just the two of them, I hope.

00:11:12.490 --> 00:11:13.250
That's right.

00:11:13.690 --> 00:11:17.780
Does he even know what training is?

00:11:28.410 --> 00:11:29.560
Damn it!

00:11:29.560 --> 00:11:31.120
Was that a win?

00:11:31.620 --> 00:11:33.090
Or a loss?

00:11:33.090 --> 00:11:35.280
There's no winning and losing in training!

00:11:35.280 --> 00:11:37.010
Training is training!

00:11:37.010 --> 00:11:38.010
It looks fun.

00:11:43.880 --> 00:11:47.170
Giruu says I have to, 
that's the only reason I'm doing it.

00:11:47.170 --> 00:11:50.850
He says we can't leave until I 
finish my training regimen.

00:11:52.270 --> 00:11:55.610
I want to go destroy Dagan Zot right now.

00:12:32.440 --> 00:12:35.310
You've got guts, baring your fangs at me.

00:12:35.590 --> 00:12:36.400
Come!

00:12:45.790 --> 00:12:47.170
I'm not done yet!

00:12:49.990 --> 00:12:50.950
Saraato!

00:12:50.950 --> 00:12:51.830
Hey!

00:12:52.830 --> 00:12:54.550
Wait! Over here!

00:12:58.470 --> 00:13:00.080
Saraato, don't move!

00:13:01.410 --> 00:13:03.050
Damn you!

00:13:27.910 --> 00:13:29.030
Saraato!

00:13:30.100 --> 00:13:32.120
Saraato... Are you okay?

00:13:33.420 --> 00:13:35.150
It doesn't look like you're hurt.

00:13:38.740 --> 00:13:40.940
Did something happen?

00:13:40.940 --> 00:13:43.410
I got tired all of a sudden.

00:13:44.210 --> 00:13:47.750
Did you fall asleep?

00:13:48.270 --> 00:13:50.380
With your eyes open?

00:13:50.900 --> 00:13:52.640
That happens sometimes.

00:13:55.690 --> 00:13:56.430
You're hurt.

00:13:58.250 --> 00:13:59.350
I'm fine.

00:14:00.090 --> 00:14:01.480
It's nothing.

00:14:23.870 --> 00:14:24.650
Huh?

00:14:26.780 --> 00:14:27.720
It's fixed.

00:14:29.210 --> 00:14:30.720
Th-Thank you.

00:14:38.760 --> 00:14:39.790
Here you go.

00:14:41.420 --> 00:14:43.080
It's pretty and shiny.

00:14:43.080 --> 00:14:44.650
A pretty pebble.

00:14:45.900 --> 00:14:47.220
What?

00:14:47.220 --> 00:14:49.700
The first money I earn and this is all I get!

00:14:49.700 --> 00:14:52.610
Don't leave me, Daddy!

00:14:53.430 --> 00:14:54.530
Let me go!

00:14:54.950 --> 00:15:01.500
The lord of the town has told us to 
have you work in the magic stone mines!

00:15:01.730 --> 00:15:03.240
Stop!

00:15:09.940 --> 00:15:12.590
A hero never leaves a good deed undone!

00:15:14.510 --> 00:15:16.130
Saraato, stay here.

00:15:16.130 --> 00:15:16.890
Okay.

00:15:17.680 --> 00:15:19.110
Stop.

00:15:20.460 --> 00:15:21.950
Let him go.

00:15:22.940 --> 00:15:23.730
Who are you?

00:15:24.050 --> 00:15:26.070
I said let him go.

00:15:26.420 --> 00:15:27.570
What are you doing?

00:15:34.300 --> 00:15:35.630
Take him, too.

00:15:35.630 --> 00:15:36.250
Okay.

00:15:54.780 --> 00:15:56.280
What are you doing by yourself?

00:15:56.280 --> 00:15:57.380
What happened?

00:16:02.160 --> 00:16:03.540
<i>Not only did they take my sword,</i>

00:16:03.540 --> 00:16:06.550
<i>they took the first money I earned.</i>

00:16:06.550 --> 00:16:10.150
Sorry to get you caught up in this, too.

00:16:10.430 --> 00:16:12.210
I'm not just caught up in it!

00:16:12.210 --> 00:16:14.980
This is terrible! How can they let it happen?

00:16:14.980 --> 00:16:21.550
But they say that once you go to 
the mines you never come back.

00:16:22.790 --> 00:16:24.830
I'm sure we'll...

00:16:24.830 --> 00:16:26.270
Don't give up.

00:16:27.360 --> 00:16:29.370
There's a way out.

00:16:30.460 --> 00:16:31.390
This!

00:16:32.090 --> 00:16:34.180
That's...

00:16:34.180 --> 00:16:35.280
...no good.

00:16:39.960 --> 00:16:42.750
Why is my magic not working 
right all of a sudden?

00:16:45.670 --> 00:16:48.100
Stupid thing!

00:16:48.530 --> 00:16:49.710
We have information!

00:16:49.710 --> 00:16:51.350
Did you find him?

00:16:51.350 --> 00:16:53.110
He's being held at the lord's palace.

00:16:53.570 --> 00:16:54.890
The lord's palace?

00:16:54.890 --> 00:16:55.720
Sheesh.

00:16:55.720 --> 00:16:56.700
Let's go.

00:17:01.130 --> 00:17:02.380
I knew it.

00:17:04.610 --> 00:17:06.790
The more power you have, 
the bigger a coward you are.

00:17:06.790 --> 00:17:10.430
And cowards like to make escape routes.

00:17:11.620 --> 00:17:14.090
Is this the way to Hiiro?

00:17:15.170 --> 00:17:17.640
When did you get here?

00:17:23.870 --> 00:17:25.760
We can get out!

00:17:25.760 --> 00:17:28.040
I'll get us out!

00:17:30.980 --> 00:17:35.480
He who waits too long for his 
chance shall find it never comes.

00:17:39.610 --> 00:17:43.460
"I can't force you to do 
anything, my lord?" Hah!

00:17:46.330 --> 00:17:47.620
This is pissing me off!

00:17:48.600 --> 00:17:50.400
Damn that Nambuuko!

00:17:50.400 --> 00:17:54.850
He thinks I'm just some local 
lord and does whatever he wants.

00:17:59.780 --> 00:18:00.640
What?

00:18:10.020 --> 00:18:11.290
It's gone!

00:18:11.290 --> 00:18:12.360
Wh-What is this?!

00:18:12.700 --> 00:18:15.590
Hey, cowardly lord.

00:18:17.280 --> 00:18:19.860
Where did you come from?

00:18:19.860 --> 00:18:21.740
Forget that. Look at this.

00:18:22.140 --> 00:18:23.710
That ledger!

00:18:24.500 --> 00:18:32.690
You sure it's okay for a local lord to use 
dual ledgers to steal money from the king?

00:18:32.690 --> 00:18:35.450
If I took this to the palace,

00:18:35.450 --> 00:18:37.030
what would happen to you?

00:18:37.030 --> 00:18:38.620
Fool!

00:18:38.620 --> 00:18:44.100
You think just because you have 
that you can leave this mansion?

00:18:44.440 --> 00:18:46.210
I made it in.

00:18:46.210 --> 00:18:49.480
I can make it out. For sure.

00:18:50.690 --> 00:18:51.820
Give that back!

00:18:51.820 --> 00:18:52.980
Sure.

00:18:52.980 --> 00:18:54.570
But I have conditions.

00:18:55.310 --> 00:18:55.940
What?

00:18:56.290 --> 00:19:00.790
One, let the kid in the prison go.

00:19:01.500 --> 00:19:06.540
Two, let the people you enslaved 
to work in the mines go.

00:19:06.540 --> 00:19:07.960
Idiot.

00:19:13.590 --> 00:19:14.570
Damn it!

00:19:17.330 --> 00:19:18.300
Wait.

00:19:25.640 --> 00:19:27.210
So tired.

00:19:28.500 --> 00:19:29.680
We made it.

00:19:30.000 --> 00:19:31.830
You're those...

00:19:32.280 --> 00:19:33.900
Who are you?

00:19:33.900 --> 00:19:36.270
Someone who had his hunt interrupted.

00:19:37.510 --> 00:19:38.940
Arrest them all.

00:19:41.220 --> 00:19:43.110
I don't know the plan.

00:19:43.110 --> 00:19:44.450
What do I do?

00:19:44.450 --> 00:19:45.490
That ledger!

00:19:45.980 --> 00:19:48.540
If we get it, we can save Hiiro!

00:19:48.850 --> 00:19:49.960
Save the young master?

00:19:55.710 --> 00:19:57.050
Nice work.

00:19:58.230 --> 00:20:01.990
Now trade this ledger for the hostages.

00:20:07.020 --> 00:20:10.200
Young Master, I'm glad you're safe.

00:20:10.690 --> 00:20:14.400
If I'd had just a bit more
time, I could've made a hole.

00:20:14.660 --> 00:20:15.190
Huh?

00:20:15.190 --> 00:20:16.770
Nothing.

00:20:17.450 --> 00:20:19.240
Anyway, you saved me.

00:20:19.240 --> 00:20:20.940
Don't do anything dumb again.

00:20:22.970 --> 00:20:24.870
You came for me.

00:20:24.870 --> 00:20:26.160
I can find...

00:20:26.610 --> 00:20:29.160
...what's important, huh?

00:20:31.650 --> 00:20:34.020
He's totally in love.

00:20:34.020 --> 00:20:36.170
Who cares? This is stupid.

00:20:37.050 --> 00:20:39.170
Where's the kid you caught?!

00:20:39.400 --> 00:20:41.550
I just released him.

00:20:41.550 --> 00:20:43.500
Released him?!

00:20:49.870 --> 00:20:51.470
Welcome back!

00:20:52.090 --> 00:20:54.350
The kids and their parents look happy.

00:20:54.610 --> 00:20:56.150
Of course they do.

00:20:56.150 --> 00:20:57.790
That's what it means to have a family.

00:20:57.790 --> 00:21:00.670
Like you know. You don't 
have a family either.

00:21:00.670 --> 00:21:03.000
Yeah, I don't really remember.

00:21:03.000 --> 00:21:03.780
But...

00:21:13.130 --> 00:21:15.770
There are some things I remember.

00:21:16.530 --> 00:21:17.310
I see.

00:21:17.970 --> 00:21:22.050
That's why I'm taking out Dagan Zot!

00:21:37.940 --> 00:21:39.950
If you're not going to eat it, I will.

00:21:40.370 --> 00:21:41.320
I'm going to eat it.

00:21:41.740 --> 00:21:42.940
It's cold out.

00:21:42.940 --> 00:21:44.010
Eat inside.

00:21:50.510 --> 00:21:51.780
I can't get enough of these vegetables.

00:21:51.500 --> 00:21:51.780
Yeah.

00:21:52.010 --> 00:21:53.440
Family, huh?

00:21:53.440 --> 00:21:57.340
Boss, if you don't hurry, 
there'll be nothing left.

00:21:58.230 --> 00:22:03.370
You know I always tell you 
to save some for me, right?

